     4	//!
     5	//! Ports `net.minecraft.world.entity.raid.{Raids,Raid,Raider}` (vanilla 26.2 decompile).
     6	//!
     7	//! Trigger path: `BadOmenMobEffect`/`RaidOmenMobEffect` (`crate::entity::living::LivingEntity`
     8	//! `should_apply_effect_tick`/`apply_effect_tick`, `BAD_OMEN`/`RAID_OMEN` branches) convert
     9	//! `BAD_OMEN` into `RAID_OMEN` on entering a real village (`World::is_close_to_village`, backed
    10	//! by `world::village_poi`'s POI-density tracker) and, on `RAID_OMEN` expiry, call
    11	//! `RaidManager::create_or_extend_raid` - which computes the raid center from real occupied
    12	//! `village`-tag POIs, mirroring `Raids.createOrExtendRaid`.
    13	//!
    14	//! Scope reductions (no vanilla-parity infrastructure exists yet for these; see
    15	//! `pumpkin/src/world/mod.rs` `RaidManager` field and `CLAUDE.md`/`PARITY.md`):
    16	//! - The raid center never re-centers onto a real village once triggered
    17	//!   (`moveRaidCenterToNearbyVillageSection` is not ported), and a raid is never lost for
    18	//!   "no longer a village" (`Raid.java` lines 287-297).
    19	//! - `village_poi`'s job-site/meeting-point POIs are never claimed by anything in Pumpkin (see
    20	//!   that module's docs), so in practice only claimed beds (`HOME`) register as "occupied" -
    21	//!   village detection is real but currently under-populated relative to vanilla.
    22	//! - `EnvironmentAttributes.CAN_START_RAID` (`Raids.createOrExtendRaid`) is not checked - no
    23	//!   such attribute system exists in Pumpkin.
    24	//! - `ServerPlayer.raidOmenPosition` (`Player::raid_omen_position`) is not persisted to NBT;
    25	//!   a relog while `RAID_OMEN` is active drops the pending raid trigger instead of resuming it.
    26	//! - `Raid.findRandomSpawnPos` drops the `isVillage`/chunk-loaded/`SpawnPlacements` legality
    27	//!   checks and only checks the vertical-distance bound (`Raid.java` line 675).
    28	//! - No banner-pattern rendering: the wave leader is equipped with a plain white banner
    29	//!   instead of the ominous banner's exact pattern layers (`Raid.getBannerComponentPatch`).
    30	//! - `ObtainRaidLeaderBannerGoal`/`RaiderMoveThroughVillageGoal`/`RaiderCelebration` AI goals
    31	//!   (`Raider.java`) are not ported: raiders fight using their existing hostile-mob goals only.
    32	//! - Advancement/statistics hooks (`CriteriaTriggers.RAID_OMEN`/`RAID_WIN`, `Stats.RAID_TRIGGER`/
    33	//!   `RAID_WIN`) are not ported.
    34	//! - `Raid.getEnchantOdds` (bonus-enchant chance on raider gear by omen level) is not ported;
